Design references (ideas, not code)
-----------------------------------
- The four-verb protocol shape (context / observe / recall / reflect) is an
  original design informed by common agent lifecycle conventions, including the
  Model Context Protocol's tool conventions.
- The emotion taxonomy *structure* used by the future affect layer (7 categories,
  intensity 1–9, polarity) follows the publicly documented structure of the
  Dalian University of Technology affective lexicon (DUTIR).

  No word list from DUTIR — or from any third-party lexicon — is bundled here.
  Any lexicon a user supplies remains subject to that user's own licensing
  obligations. See docs/adr/0006-licensing.md.

